  "final_span": "Growth was joined by Representatives Sarah Bowman, Colleen Landrum, and Jess Ferguson, as well as Greenfield Mayor Roxanne Hemmingway Hathaway.\nDuring the majority of the public meeting, commissioners concentrated on issues related to COVID-19 relief funds.\nThe presentation of Highland County Jobs and Family Services' (JFS) seek for Fiscal Year 2023 (FY23) Coronavirus Response Funds was scheduled for discussion. The ARPA FY23 allocation was directed to the county\u2019s JFS program in the amount of $1.823 million.\nCommissioners previously sanctioned a $640,000 request from the fund and then approved an additional $1,057,000 a few weeks afterward.\nEarlier this session, Wilkin brought the final $675,000",
